    <main class="trading-page algo-page">
  <section class="m3x-sec m3x-sec--hero trade-hero"><div class="trade-wrap trade-split">
    <div class="trade-hero-copy"><span class="trade-label">Algorithmic trading</span><h1>Build a process you can <span class="text-mint">repeat.</span></h1><p class="trade-lead">Use data-backed alerts as inputs to a disciplined trading process. Market360X handles market scanning and alerts, while you apply your rules and make the final decision.</p><div class="trade-actions"><a class="trade-button" href="/nifty-alert">Explore the platform<svg viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m7 4 5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a><a class="trade-text-link" href="#how-it-works">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="algo-principles"><span>Consistent inputs</span><span>Clear levels</span><span>Human control</span></div></div>
    <div class="trade-panel trade-preview"><div class="trade-panel-head"><span>A systematic signal workflow</span><small>Conceptual overview</small></div><div class="algo-engine"><div class="algo-inputs"><span>Price action</span><span>Market flow</span><span>Sentiment</span></div><div class="algo-connector"></div><div class="algo-core"><img src="/images/logo/logo-small.svg" alt=""/><b>Market360X analysis</b><p>Scan the market. Surface the setup.</p></div><div class="algo-connector"></div><div class="algo-result"><div><b>Alert + market context</b><small>Review against your own rules</small></div><span class="trade-tag">YOUR DECISION</span></div></div></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="m3x-sec trade-section"><div class="trade-wrap trade-split trade-rule" style="padding-top:48px"><div class="trade-copy"><span class="trade-label">What is algo trading?</span><h2>Rules bring structure <span class="text-mint">to market decisions.</span></h2></div><div class="trade-copy"><p>Algorithmic trading uses predefined rules and data to identify opportunities or manage execution. A rule might combine price, volume, timing or other conditions.</p><p>Market360X supports the research and signal side of that workflow. Its analysis and alerts help you evaluate opportunities; it does not automatically place orders for you.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="m3x-sec trade-section" id="how-it-works"><div class="trade-wrap trade-split">
    <div class="trade-copy"><span class="trade-label">From scanning to a decision</span><h2>Less screen watching.<br><span class="text-mint">More consistency.</span></h2><p>Manual scanning makes it difficult to monitor several markets and apply the same criteria every time. A repeatable review process helps keep a busy market from dictating your decisions.</p><a class="trade-text-link" href="/features">Explore signal features →</a></div>
    <div class="algo-steps"><article class="algo-step"><h3>Define what you are looking for</h3><p>Choose the market, the conditions you want to see and the risk you are willing to take before a signal arrives.</p></article><article class="algo-step"><h3>Let the signals come to you</h3><p>Use Market360X alerts to surface potential setups without watching every chart continuously.</p></article><article class="algo-step"><h3>Check the idea against your rules</h3><p>Review the alert and its market context. Skip alerts that do not meet your criteria.</p></article><article class="algo-step"><h3>Make and review your decision</h3><p>You control execution. Keep a record of your reasoning so you can review how consistently you followed your process.</p></article></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="m3x-sec trade-section"><div class="trade-wrap"><div class="algo-discipline"><div><span class="trade-label">Why choose Market360X</span><h2>Useful inputs for <span class="text-mint">your own system.</span></h2><p style="margin-top:20px">Bring the data behind an idea into one place, from the first alert to the levels you need to evaluate.</p></div><ul class="trade-points"><li>Data scanning across supported markets</li><li>Price action, flow and sentiment in context</li><li>Alerts with direction, signal strength and context</li><li>Alerts that fit your trading routine</li></ul></div></div></section>
  <section class="m3x-sec trade-section"><div class="trade-wrap trade-split"><h2>Know what <span class="text-mint">the platform does.</span></h2><div class="trade-faq"><details><summary>Will Market360X run a trading bot for me?</summary><p>No. The platform provides market analysis and alerts. Automated order execution is not part of the workflow described here.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to write code?</summary><p>You can review Market360X signals and alerts without writing code. Any separate algorithm, broker integration or execution system is your own setup.</p></details><details><summary>Can a consistent process still lose money?</summary><p>Yes. Markets change, and a repeatable process does not guarantee profitable outcomes. Evaluate each idea and account for risk, trading costs and execution conditions.</p></details></div></div></section>
